  "code": "#include <stdio.h>\nint main()\n{ \n   char c, sentence[ 80 ];\n   int i = 0;\n   puts( \"Enter a line of text:\" );\n   while ( ( c = getchar() ) != '\\n') \n      sentence[ i++ ] = c;\n   sentence[ i ] = '\\0';  /* insert null at end of string */\n   puts( \"\\nThe line entered was:\" );\n   puts( sentence );\n   return 0;\n}\n}",
